1
00:01:31,730 --> 00:01:34,900
[In My Prime]

2
00:01:35,330 --> 00:01:37,660
[Episode 6]

3
00:01:53,039 --> 00:01:53,560
Hello,

4
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,590
honey.

5
00:01:56,509 --> 00:01:57,910
When are you coming back?

6
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,360
I can't fall asleep without you.

7
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:02,350
I...

8
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:03,710
Hello?

9
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,680
Hello?

10
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:09,130
She hung up on me again.

11
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:21,960
Just find a way

12
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,750
to subtly let her know that

13
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,960
some of the help she's giving

14
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,020
is already putting

15
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,079
a strain

16
00:02:29,630 --> 00:02:30,360
on you, on me,

17
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,240
and on everyone.

18
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,530
That will do.

19
00:02:48,590 --> 00:02:50,120
You must be Aihua's mother!

20
00:02:51,710 --> 00:02:52,470
And you are?

21
00:02:52,750 --> 00:02:54,000
I'm from the Neighborhood Committee.

22
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,470
Your neighbors have complained about

23
00:02:55,470 --> 00:02:57,150
a foul smell
that's always coming from your house.

24
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,240
I'm here to check.

25
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,360
Where is the foul smell?

26
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:02,440
Why can't I smell it?

27
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:03,870
You city people

28
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,300
are just too fussy.

29
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:07,840
I'm pickling some vegetables

30
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,920
in my own house.

31
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:10,110
What's wrong?

32
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,430
Does it have anything to do with you?

33
00:03:12,430 --> 00:03:13,690
I can do whatever I want

34
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:15,120
at my own place.

35
00:03:15,710 --> 00:03:16,960
Not even God could

36
00:03:17,470 --> 00:03:18,470
tell me what to do!

37
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:20,280
You...

38
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:22,690
What kind of attitude is that?

39
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,220
In this math exam,

40
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,400
none of you did very well.

41
00:03:29,750 --> 00:03:31,870
You need to review your mistakes later.

42
00:03:31,870 --> 00:03:33,070
Cao Xin, first place,

43
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,910
129 points.

44
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:41,010
Thank you, sir.

45
00:03:42,910 --> 00:03:43,570
Tian Zihao,

46
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,190
88 points.

47
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,560
There are only two

48
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:48,720
in our class who failed the exam.

49
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,100
Thank you, sir.

50
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,079
At least I've got a fellow classmate

51
00:03:53,079 --> 00:03:54,540
who also failed this time.

52
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:56,190
Qi Shi,

53
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:57,910
89 points.

54
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:00,800
-Qi Shi?
-Qi Shi?

55
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,680
Never thought

56
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:03,350
Qi Shi would be at the bottom with me.

57
00:04:03,350 --> 00:04:04,610
What's wrong with you?

58
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:06,500
How did your grades drop so much?

59
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:08,280
I'm sorry, sir.

60
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:12,570
Wang Yuxin,

61
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,630
93 points.

62
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:18,750
Your homeroom teacher

63
00:04:18,769 --> 00:04:19,700
came by today,

64
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,280
saying your grades

65
00:04:22,310 --> 00:04:23,560
dropped greatly recently

66
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:26,090
because you spent
your spare time collecting

67
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,640
scrap cardboard with me.

68
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,190
I could tell it.

69
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,600
Your teacher

70
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:32,650
was implying that

71
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,810
I'm holding you back from your studies

72
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,320
and ruining your future.

73
00:04:36,909 --> 00:04:37,480
Grandma,

74
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:39,710
I really want to focus on my studies.

75
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:40,480
I...

76
00:04:41,830 --> 00:04:42,360
Mom,

77
00:04:43,310 --> 00:04:44,630
did you have a fight with the staff from

78
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:45,830
the Neighborhood Committee?

79
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:46,630
What's wrong?

80
00:04:48,190 --> 00:04:49,920
Our household got a complaint.

81
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:50,750
They said

82
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:52,310
they came to mediate this morning,

83
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:53,740
and you kicked them out.

84
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,040
Is that true?

85
00:04:56,030 --> 00:04:57,120
In the end, they reported it

86
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,190
to the Health Bureau.

87
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:59,280
This matter has blown up.

88
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,510
I was simply pickling vegetables

89
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:01,540
in my own home.

90
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:03,130
Does the Health Bureau

91
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:04,680
even deal with this?

92
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,160
Mom,

93
00:05:05,950 --> 00:05:07,120
p-please just dispose of

94
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,510
these pickled vegetables.

95
00:05:08,510 --> 00:05:09,240
They said

96
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,750
the Health Bureau's staff

97
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:12,160
might come and fine us.

98
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:13,870
I did nothing wrong!

99
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,000
Why fine us?

100
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,800
How am I supposed to get by with all this?

101
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,480
Mom!

102
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,650
You're not in the countryside.

103
00:05:19,770 --> 00:05:21,240
You can't just do things recklessly

104
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,770
a-as you did in the village.

105
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:24,000
Also, look,

106
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:27,310
you made Qinglian so mad
that she went back to her parents' house.

107
00:05:27,310 --> 00:05:29,000
What a mess this is!

108
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:31,950
You all think

109
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:33,360
it's my fault, right?

110
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,430
I made Shi collect scrap cardboard

111
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:37,390
to make her work more diligently!

112
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,560
Who did I pickle vegetables for?

113
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,680
Was it for myself?

114
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:42,570
It was all for you guys!

115
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,820
After all is said and done,

116
00:05:45,270 --> 00:05:46,430
you all blame me.

117
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,440
Are you despising me?

118
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:51,330
As a mother,

119
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:53,920
I'm doing everything just for you,

120
00:05:54,790 --> 00:05:56,390
and you still complain, huh?

121
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,070
Fine.

122
00:06:00,380 --> 00:06:01,950
You three are a family,

123
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,980
and I'm the only outsider.

124
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,800
Since you're all upset about me,

125
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,840
I won't stay here any longer

126
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:09,670
as a nuisance.

127
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,160
Grandma,

128
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:12,600
that's not what we meant.

129
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:13,600
Yeah, Mom,

130
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,240
that's not what we meant.

131
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,370
Please don't be mad.

132
00:06:16,470 --> 00:06:17,040
Grandma.

133
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:18,000
Mom.

134
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,270
-Mom...
-Grandma.

135
00:06:19,270 --> 00:06:19,720
Mom...

136
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:22,600
Calm down, please.

137
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,120
If you're really going to leave,

138
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:24,960
have a meal first,

139
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:26,760
and I'll take you to the station!

140
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,250
Go see your grandma off.

141
00:06:32,270 --> 00:06:34,000
That's your mom. Why don't you go?

142
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,870
My mom left.

143
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,700
So I have to go pick up your mom.

144
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:37,280
Go ahead.

145
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,950
Grandma, wait for me!

146
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,250
Grandpa,

147
00:06:45,409 --> 00:06:46,630
out of 150 points,

148
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,010
90 is a passing grade,

149
00:06:49,010 --> 00:06:51,180
and she scored exactly 89,

150
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,520
right on the edge of passing.

151
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:54,680
What does that mean?

152
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,159
Xin.

153
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:59,320
Qi Shi

154
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:02,360
got not a point more or a point less,

155
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,630
just enough to fail.

156
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,050
What does this mean?

157
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,030
She knows all the correct answers!

158
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:09,070
And it just perfectly triggered

159
00:07:09,070 --> 00:07:10,360
her grandma's guilt.

160
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,630
I knew

161
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:14,070
someone could deal with this old madam.

162
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,750
I can finally go home.

163
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,310
Grandma,

164
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:26,040
you seem quite happy.

165
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:27,990
I'm going back to my own home.

166
00:07:27,990 --> 00:07:29,320
How could I not be happy?

167
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:31,190
Over the past few days at your place,

168
00:07:31,190 --> 00:07:32,570
I could neither eat well

169
00:07:32,590 --> 00:07:33,550
nor sleep well,

170
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:35,190
and nothing went my way.

171
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:37,950
There were endless things
springing up every day

172
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,550
to deal with and worry about.

173
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,040
I've been dog-tired.

174
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:41,830
Well,

175
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,120
then why didn't you go back earlier?

176
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,720
I wanted to leave a long time ago.

177
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,750
But seeing how you guys

178
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:48,430
seem to need me for everything,

179
00:07:48,430 --> 00:07:50,890
I couldn't bring myself
to leave you behind.

180
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:54,320
So in your eyes,

181
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:55,830
we are a big burden.

182
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:58,430
You are burdens.

183
00:07:58,630 --> 00:07:59,600
But I am

184
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,120
willing to carry you.

185
00:08:01,270 --> 00:08:01,750
You're

186
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,720
all troublemakers.

187
00:08:03,930 --> 00:08:05,590
But what can I do? I'm a mother.

188
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,650
Alright.

189
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,460
Go back now.

190
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:08,680
G-Grandma.

191
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:09,360
I...

192
00:08:09,870 --> 00:08:11,870
I want to confess something to you.

193
00:08:12,190 --> 00:08:13,050
Anything else?

194
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,120
I did poorly on this exam

195
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,380
on purpose, actually.

196
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:17,190
I...

197
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:20,000
I knew we could make money
by collecting cardboard,

198
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,360
but it was really scorching hot
in the sun.

199
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,390
I didn't want to do it,

200
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:24,390
so I came up with this terrible idea.

201
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,950
You brat.

202
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,330
At my age,

203
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,240
I still got lectured
by your teacher for ages.

204
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:30,950
Do you have any idea

205
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:32,480
how worried I was about you?

206
00:08:32,690 --> 00:08:33,690
You... You brat.

207
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,669
Why are you so disobedient?

208
00:08:34,669 --> 00:08:35,510
Grandma, Grandma...

209
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,840
Don't be mad. Calm down.

210
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:38,080
If you get sick over this, we'll pay

211
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:38,630
for treatment.

212
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,360
It's not worth it.

213
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,200
Alright, alright.

214
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,200
Alright, enough.

215
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:41,900
Go back now.

216
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:42,730
I'm leaving.

217
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,630
Qi Shi,

218
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,000
listen to me

219
00:08:47,550 --> 00:08:49,150
and take off your wig.

220
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:51,300
It's not good to always keep it on.

221
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,080
Also,

222
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,550
be more diligent.

223
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,080
Don't take after your mom.

224
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,120
Lazybones

225
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:58,470
don't have good luck.

226
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:00,000
I got it.

227
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,800
I'm leaving. You may go back.

228
00:09:11,030 --> 00:09:12,320
Qi Shi, go back now.

229
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,060
Go back.

230
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,280
Bye, Grandma.

231
00:09:15,030 --> 00:09:15,960
Go back, go back.

232
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:18,610
You may go back now.

233
00:09:42,940 --> 00:09:43,600
Let me do it.

234
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,480
Honey, you've suffered.

235
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,600
Anyway,

236
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,100
through our joint efforts,

237
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:57,120
we finally talked my mom

238
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:58,990
into going back home.

239
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,310
Keep it there.

240
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,520
In the future,

241
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:07,140
our household

242
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,860
will still be yours to manage.

243
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:14,040
Alright.

244
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,320
Qi Shi, time to eat.

245
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:20,000
When I was at my parents' house
the past few days,

246
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,720
I also reflected

247
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,960
on myself seriously.

248
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:25,480
With your mom's bossy attitude

249
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:27,330
when she talks,

250
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,020
she's actually quite like me.

251
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:30,550
So from now on, I will

252
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:32,280
change my attitude at home.

253
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,200
Is this still my mom?

254
00:10:39,010 --> 00:10:41,010
I fried an egg specifically for you.

255
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,360
No more pickles.

256
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,140
Let me do it. Let me.

257
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,870
Bossy people are

258
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,300
indeed not popular

259
00:11:03,550 --> 00:11:04,480
with others.

260
00:11:04,950 --> 00:11:06,030
Despite their good intentions,

261
00:11:06,030 --> 00:11:07,270
others still won't appreciate it.

262
00:11:07,270 --> 00:11:09,000
I don't want to be like your grandma.

263
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,660
I've decided that from now on,

264
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:11,600
I'll change,

265
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,030
be tolerant,

266
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,570
and be open-minded.

267
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:15,200
Aihua,

268
00:11:15,910 --> 00:11:18,040
do you want me to fry an egg for you, too?

269
00:11:21,710 --> 00:11:23,290
C-Can I have it?

270
00:11:23,430 --> 00:11:28,080
[Art of Marriage]

271
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:38,030
Why did Mom start reading a book?

272
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,850
Don't underestimate your mom.

273
00:11:41,430 --> 00:11:43,290
Your mom actually

274
00:11:43,310 --> 00:11:44,570
finished junior high.

275
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,550
You know what?

276
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,640
Comparison makes a difference.

277
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,280
Your grandma's visit

278
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:55,000
made your mom fully realize

279
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:56,630
the wisdom of managing a household.

280
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:57,000
Look,

281
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:59,200
she's started to learn right away.

282
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,360
Your grandma's visit

283
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,360
was well worth it.

284
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,360
So do you think

285
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:06,150
our days

286
00:12:06,390 --> 00:12:08,240
are going to get better?

287
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,120
Yes.

288
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:12,240
You know what?

289
00:12:12,270 --> 00:12:12,930
From now on,

290
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,910
we can just enjoy our lives.

291
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,930
This water is a bit cold.

292
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,020
Add some more hot water for me.

293
00:12:32,370 --> 00:12:32,960
Honey.

294
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:36,000
Could you cut two slices of ginger for me

295
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,670
to warm up?

296
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:38,840
Is this okay?

297
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:39,660
Yep.

298
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,120
Mom,

299
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,510
I want some fried mushrooms.

300
00:12:44,510 --> 00:12:45,600
Put more cumin.

301
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:50,600
Mom!

302
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,440
I want to eat fried mushrooms right now.

303
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:58,550
Could you give me a foot massage?

304
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,260
I'm a bit tired from standing all day.

305
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,630
A foot massage?

306
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:14,030
I think you're asking for a beating!

307
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:15,550
You two are getting on my nerves,

308
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:16,070
huh?

309
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,670
You two can't live a day
without causing trouble,

310
00:13:20,670 --> 00:13:21,130
can you?

311
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,550
You're making demands of me? How dare you?

312
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:24,100
And you!

313
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:24,870
Don't run away!

314
00:13:24,870 --> 00:13:26,200
You think I'm a pushover

315
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:28,240
just because I haven't shown you
what I've got?

316
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,220
Where are you two going to hide?

317
00:13:29,220 --> 00:13:30,020
Get down here!

318
00:13:31,390 --> 00:13:32,250
How dare you two

319
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:34,430
walk all over me?

320
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,880
No food for you tomorrow!

321
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,870
Mom is so back.

322
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,440
This is your real mom.

323
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,850
Don't just eat meat.

324
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:04,840
Have some veggies

325
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,600
for balanced nutrition.

326
00:14:08,110 --> 00:14:08,840
Thanks, Dad.

327
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:10,840
In my point of view,

328
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:12,150
you should eat

329
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:14,030
even more meat.

330
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,570
Otherwise,

331
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:17,510
how can you finish the huge pile

332
00:14:18,150 --> 00:14:18,720
of homework

333
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:20,180
your dad has assigned you?

334
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,510
Dad,

335
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,240
after Old Madam Qi came,

336
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:29,870
Mrs. Huo has become
a whole different person.

337
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:31,530
She is friendly with everyone

338
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:34,000
and doesn't even dare to breathe heavily.

339
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,670
When my mom was alive,

340
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:38,580
did she also act that way before Grandma?

341
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,360
Your grandma passed away

342
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,890
even earlier than your mom.

343
00:14:44,900 --> 00:14:46,300
They didn't have the time

344
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:48,050
or the chance to not get along.

345
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:04,200
These neighbors of ours

346
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:06,630
make a fuss

347
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:08,150
every day.

348
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,670
It's so chaotic,

349
00:15:10,690 --> 00:15:11,240
isn't it?

350
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:15,910
Our home is much better.

351
00:15:16,150 --> 00:15:17,280
Quiet and peaceful.

352
00:15:43,410 --> 00:15:43,970
What?

353
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:49,080
Big guy, you didn't grow for nothing.

354
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,910
You actually know how to help now.

355
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:51,630
I will

356
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,680
wash my own clothes from now on.

357
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,300
Just leave it to me.

358
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:59,800
You're getting passionate
after a few compliments, huh?

359
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:01,360
What? Are you shy?

360
00:16:03,030 --> 00:16:03,840
You know,

361
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,150
I've been washing your clothes

362
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:07,000
for as long as

363
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:08,090
you've been alive,

364
00:16:08,390 --> 00:16:08,990
ever since

365
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,130
you were in diapers.

366
00:16:11,670 --> 00:16:13,000
I was a little kid myself

367
00:16:13,150 --> 00:16:14,350
and wasn't very tall.

368
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,910
I would take a small stool,

369
00:16:15,910 --> 00:16:16,570
stand on it,

370
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,910
and keep scrubbing.

371
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,880
But I just couldn't scrub it off.

372
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,840
So for a long time,

373
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:24,490
you smelled sour.

374
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,610
You're so annoying!

375
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,210
What else could I do?

376
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:34,030
It's not your fault
you were born without a mom.

377
00:16:34,030 --> 00:16:36,030
At least I had Mom around for 4 years.

378
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:37,770
I'd just get myself

379
00:16:37,770 --> 00:16:38,970
to be half a mom to you.

380
00:16:40,770 --> 00:16:42,420
But you were also a kid back then.

381
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:43,950
Who was there to be your mom?

382
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,630
I had Mrs. Huo.

383
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:49,200
Later...

384
00:16:55,390 --> 00:16:56,720
But you've grown up now

385
00:16:56,860 --> 00:16:58,520
and can take care of yourself.

386
00:16:58,790 --> 00:16:59,480
I won't be able to be

387
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,600
like your mom for much longer.

388
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:01,460
Give them to me.

389
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:03,190
We agreed I'd do it myself.

390
00:17:03,630 --> 00:17:04,430
Here's yours.

391
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:31,000
How are you going to live

392
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:31,680
on your own?

393
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:33,960
You don't even know how to fold clothes.

394
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,920
Fold these two sleeves back.

395
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:44,160
Like this, this...

396
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:44,510
See?

397
00:17:46,270 --> 00:17:46,830
Done.

398
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:50,880
So easy.

399
00:17:52,310 --> 00:17:54,710
Good students just have different brains.

400
00:17:56,750 --> 00:17:57,340
Li Bo,

401
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,680
good luck with the game this afternoon.

402
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,240
Catch it.

403
00:18:00,030 --> 00:18:00,590
So smelly.

404
00:18:00,590 --> 00:18:01,320
Don't worry.

405
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,200
We won't lose.

406
00:18:02,830 --> 00:18:03,760
Listen, you must

407
00:18:04,030 --> 00:18:05,240
do your best for the Central League

408
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,170
this afternoon.

409
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,430
No worries.

410
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:08,950
You know how good I am.

411
00:18:09,110 --> 00:18:09,680
Qi Shi.

412
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:10,550
Qi Shi!

413
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:12,440
Can I borrow your science paper?

414
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:13,240
-Okay.
-I didn't solve

415
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:14,640
the last major question.

416
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:25,340
Not bad, Cao Xin.

417
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:27,400
You even got this question right.

418
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:27,960
But

419
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:29,160
why did you score 20 points

420
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,090
less than Qi Shi?

421
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:30,980
I thought you

422
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:32,880
only missed the last major question.

423
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:33,960
When it comes to studying,

424
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:36,560
you need a role model
who's truly exceptional.

425
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:37,980
Check out my paper, girl.

426
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:39,040
It's the real deal.

427
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,720
You got 4 multiple-choice questions wrong?

428
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,160
Wait,

429
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:47,070
even I got this question right!

430
00:18:47,070 --> 00:18:48,000
What's wrong with you?

431
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,660
I felt drowsy during the exam.

432
00:18:49,930 --> 00:18:50,720
I wasn't sober when doing

433
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,720
those questions.

434
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:56,240
You really can make things up.

435
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,240
What do you mean?

436
00:18:57,750 --> 00:18:59,030
You woke up as you did more questions?

437
00:18:59,030 --> 00:18:59,680
Can't I?

438
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:01,450
You can, you can.

439
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:03,310
I wonder who was kicking himself

440
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:04,880
for being 20 points away

441
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,880
from beating me in the monthly exam.

442
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:07,830
You've worked on

443
00:19:07,830 --> 00:19:09,640
your mistake notebook so hard, right?

444
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:10,510
Is it useful?

445
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:12,110
You'll be sleepy again next time.

446
00:19:12,110 --> 00:19:12,640
No,

447
00:19:12,750 --> 00:19:14,680
you'll have a new excuse next time.

448
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:17,880
Here.

449
00:19:19,110 --> 00:19:20,160
Feel free to ask me if you

450
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,270
have any questions.

451
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:22,550
I definitely won't feel drowsy

452
00:19:22,550 --> 00:19:24,210
explaining questions to you.

453
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,490
It's been so many years.

454
00:19:28,550 --> 00:19:30,020
Why are they still bickering?

455
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:30,830
It's not your first time

456
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:31,960
being in the same class as them.

457
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,200
They've been competing
since elementary school

458
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,350
all the way until now.

459
00:19:34,350 --> 00:19:35,590
Neither will yield to the other.

460
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:36,190
Let me see.

461
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:39,750
Full marks in English.

462
00:19:40,350 --> 00:19:41,150
In my opinion,

463
00:19:41,350 --> 00:19:42,240
we normal people

464
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,770
should probably stay away,

465
00:19:44,110 --> 00:19:46,110
lest we get caught in the crossfire.

466
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:05,270
Sisi.

467
00:20:07,030 --> 00:20:07,630
Let me help you.

468
00:20:07,630 --> 00:20:08,510
No need...

469
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,120
Where should I put it?

470
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:14,150
Thank you.

471
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:15,830
Sisi...

472
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:20,830
Sisi,

473
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,440
look how hard you work every day.

474
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,340
This job doesn't suit you.

475
00:20:25,830 --> 00:20:27,160
It gives you no freedom.

476
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:29,680
You know what?

477
00:20:30,750 --> 00:20:31,680
I'm now a manager

478
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,480
at the company

479
00:20:32,830 --> 00:20:34,090
run by my dad's friend.

480
00:20:34,110 --> 00:20:35,240
Come to work with me.

481
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:37,740
I've got your back.

482
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:46,920
Sisi,

483
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,450
you look so pretty when you smile.

484
00:20:49,450 --> 00:20:50,450
I'm clocking out.

485
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:56,030
Respected teachers

486
00:20:57,510 --> 00:20:58,710
and fellow students.

487
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:05,590
Zhi,

488
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:07,160
is your training fun?

489
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,070
Listen to yourself.

490
00:21:09,070 --> 00:21:10,730
What kind of question is that?

491
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:12,960
Mom and Dad aren't here.

492
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:14,290
You can speak normally.

493
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:15,480
You want to hear normal talk?

494
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:16,440
It means

495
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:18,220
you lost your gift.

496
00:21:19,510 --> 00:21:20,440
You got me a gift?

497
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,400
Is this my gift?

498
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:23,790
This...

499
00:21:23,790 --> 00:21:24,450
Is it for me?

500
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:25,110
Don't...

501
00:21:25,110 --> 00:21:25,830
Let go, let go.

502
00:21:25,830 --> 00:21:26,440
Isn't it for me?

503
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:26,920
Let go, let go.

504
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:27,590
You let go.

505
00:21:29,350 --> 00:21:30,030
Don't break it.

506
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:31,430
This is for someone else.

507
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:33,810
"Someone else"?

508
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:35,950
You have "someone else"?

509
00:21:36,510 --> 00:21:37,310
Who is it?

510
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,110
A teacher?

511
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,510
No.

512
00:21:42,460 --> 00:21:43,160
Are you having

513
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:44,240
another sister behind my back?

514
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,310
Who else do you have? Who? Who is it?

515
00:21:46,390 --> 00:21:47,520
Move... Move aside.

516
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:48,440
Go.

517
00:21:48,550 --> 00:21:49,720
What are you doing?

518
00:21:49,750 --> 00:21:50,310
You have no gift for me,

519
00:21:50,310 --> 00:21:52,310
and you even threw away my lollipop.

520
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:53,020
Don't eat that.

521
00:21:53,020 --> 00:21:54,750
I've got you something better.

522
00:21:55,030 --> 00:21:55,510
Look.

523
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:56,820
Chocolate.

524
00:21:57,450 --> 00:21:58,000
Give me that.

525
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:58,610
What did you just say?

526
00:21:58,610 --> 00:21:59,340
Give it to me.

527
00:21:59,590 --> 00:21:59,960
I was wrong.

528
00:21:59,960 --> 00:22:00,590
What did you just say?

529
00:22:00,590 --> 00:22:01,920
I was wrong. I was wrong.

530
00:22:04,390 --> 00:22:05,850
It's imported chocolate.

531
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:09,450
We can't even buy this
at our school store.

532
00:22:09,530 --> 00:22:10,480
It's even hard to find in Haizhou,

533
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:11,750
let alone our school store.

534
00:22:11,750 --> 00:22:13,480
This is all my love for you, sister.

535
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:14,340
Thank you, Zhi.

536
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:17,350
Zhi,

537
00:22:18,030 --> 00:22:20,310
why is it so soft?

538
00:22:20,310 --> 00:22:22,400
It looks like it's been squashed.

539
00:22:23,270 --> 00:22:24,800
T-That's just the way it is.

540
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:25,530
You know,

541
00:22:25,680 --> 00:22:26,680
the more expensive

542
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:28,590
something is, the weirder it looks.

543
00:22:28,590 --> 00:22:29,510
Are you going to eat it or not?

544
00:22:29,510 --> 00:22:30,070
If not, give it to me.

545
00:22:30,070 --> 00:22:31,070
I will eat it. I will.

546
00:22:31,070 --> 00:22:31,720
My brother bought it for me,

547
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,180
so I'll definitely eat it.

548
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:36,480
And these.

549
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,640
New Concept English

550
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:38,770
and the other stuff.

551
00:22:52,070 --> 00:22:53,900
Congratulations to Qi Zhi

552
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:56,720
on winning
the men's 100-meter championship

553
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:58,850
at the Sports School's sports meet

554
00:22:58,880 --> 00:22:59,920
this semester.

555
00:23:00,310 --> 00:23:02,970
This certificate is awarded
as encouragement.

556
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:07,640
A minor championship,
not worth mentioning.

557
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:08,240
Next,

558
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:09,660
your brother will become

559
00:23:09,660 --> 00:23:11,030
the National Games champion,

560
00:23:11,030 --> 00:23:12,110
the national champion,

561
00:23:12,110 --> 00:23:13,570
and the Olympic champion.

562
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:14,240
Okay,

563
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:16,970
for the sake of the chocolate,

564
00:23:17,550 --> 00:23:18,920
I'll indulge you.

565
00:23:24,590 --> 00:23:26,790
The gold medal

566
00:23:27,070 --> 00:23:28,600
of the men's 100-meter dash

567
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:31,100
at the 2008 Beijing Olympics goes

568
00:23:31,310 --> 00:23:33,070
to the athlete from China,

569
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:34,110
Qi Zhi.

570
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:37,000
Next, please welcome the IOC President,

571
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:38,930
Qi Shi, to present the award to him.

572
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:53,200
Done.

573
00:23:57,030 --> 00:23:58,090
Congratulations,

574
00:23:58,160 --> 00:23:58,750
Qi Zhi.

575
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:00,880
You have won glory

576
00:24:01,030 --> 00:24:02,030
for your country.

577
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:06,740
Thank you, President. Thank you.

578
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,790
This is the ultimate battle

579
00:24:10,790 --> 00:24:12,400
of human speed, captivating the world.

580
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:14,600
Let's give a round of applause to Qi Zhi.

581
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:27,880
This man

582
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,480
from a small town in Northern China

583
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,270
is a young genius

584
00:24:30,270 --> 00:24:31,410
and an unexpected dark horse.

585
00:24:31,410 --> 00:24:32,240
With his own legs,

586
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:34,030
he created a miracle for China.

587
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:41,200
Zhi, how come I didn't notice

588
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:43,510
your amazing gift for bragging

589
00:24:43,530 --> 00:24:45,190
and talking big shamelessly?

590
00:24:45,500 --> 00:24:46,640
I have plenty of amazing gifts.

591
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:48,440
Take your time to discover them.

592
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:50,160
Zhi.

593
00:24:51,550 --> 00:24:51,960
Here.

594
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:55,040
I want to run for class monitor
this semester,

595
00:24:55,040 --> 00:24:55,830
but I just can't write

596
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:56,790
the speech.

597
00:24:57,070 --> 00:24:58,400
Can you help me write it?

598
00:25:02,590 --> 00:25:03,250
No problem.

599
00:25:03,790 --> 00:25:04,550
Leave

600
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:07,050
this small matter to me.

601
00:25:16,880 --> 00:25:17,410
Go ahead.

602
00:25:18,010 --> 00:25:19,210
I'll do it right away.

603
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,370
I need time to think.

604
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:30,160
The famous investment master,

605
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:33,490
the Sage of Omaha,
Warren Buffett, once said,

606
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:36,240
"If one day I am gone,

607
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:38,170
let my wife

608
00:25:38,510 --> 00:25:39,550
put all my..."

609
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:41,550
"Wife"? Seriously?

610
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:43,120
Why are you laughing?

611
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:44,030
Don't laugh.

612
00:25:45,070 --> 00:25:45,880
What is this?

613
00:25:47,310 --> 00:25:48,590
But, but...

614
00:25:49,350 --> 00:25:51,350
No matter what Buffett said,

615
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:53,090
or whatever an index fund

616
00:25:53,090 --> 00:25:54,100
is like,

617
00:25:54,420 --> 00:25:55,820
choosing a class monitor

618
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:58,240
is an investment in the future.

619
00:25:58,550 --> 00:26:00,960
Invest a vote in me today,

620
00:26:01,510 --> 00:26:04,680
and I'll return you
a bright future tomorrow.

621
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:06,720
What nonsense is she talking about?

622
00:26:07,070 --> 00:26:08,240
Seriously?

623
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:10,210
She's running for it with this?

624
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:13,030
Seriously?

625
00:26:15,160 --> 00:26:15,790
Bravo!

626
00:26:16,590 --> 00:26:17,120
Applaud!

627
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:17,720
Good!

628
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:19,430
-Good!
-Good!

629
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:31,640
Thank you, everyone.

630
00:27:05,270 --> 00:27:06,270
Hello, everyone.

631
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:08,520
I'm not very good with words.

632
00:27:09,540 --> 00:27:10,400
When it comes to sweet-talking,

633
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,330
I probably still need

634
00:27:11,330 --> 00:27:13,290
to learn from Qi Shi.

635
00:27:14,120 --> 00:27:14,930
But if I

636
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,110
become the class monitor,

637
00:27:16,110 --> 00:27:17,840
I will lead the boys in our class

638
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:20,750
to have more extracurricular activity time

639
00:27:20,750 --> 00:27:22,080
and build up our bodies.

640
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:24,040
I will also help the girls

641
00:27:24,070 --> 00:27:26,720
with their questions
and improve their grades.

642
00:27:26,720 --> 00:27:27,720
Vice versa.

643
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:28,970
Any girls

644
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:30,310
who like playing basketball

645
00:27:30,310 --> 00:27:31,960
are welcome to play sports with us.

646
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:33,130
And boys are also welcome

647
00:27:33,130 --> 00:27:35,250
to bravely speak out
about their shortcomings.

648
00:27:35,250 --> 00:27:37,520
Let's improve our grades

649
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:38,720
and grow together.

650
00:27:38,720 --> 00:27:39,750
Thank you, everyone.

651
00:27:39,750 --> 00:27:41,590
-Bravo!
-Good!

652
00:27:53,390 --> 00:27:56,500
[Cao Xin]

653
00:27:58,140 --> 00:28:00,830
[Class Cadre Election]

654
00:28:06,160 --> 00:28:07,360
So annoying!

655
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:09,680
A Pyrrhic victory.

656
00:28:11,340 --> 00:28:12,400
Let me do it. Let me.

657
00:28:12,830 --> 00:28:13,400
Let me.

658
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:16,360
Sorrow of Four-eyes,

659
00:28:16,970 --> 00:28:18,200
do you want a game time card

660
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,030
for "Stone Age"?

661
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:19,690
It's cheap.

662
00:28:20,550 --> 00:28:21,350
Yes, I do.

663
00:28:21,790 --> 00:28:22,590
How much is it?

664
00:28:26,270 --> 00:28:27,960
You're so childish.

665
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:31,070
You went to play games again
last night, right?

666
00:28:31,070 --> 00:28:32,270
Look at your eye bags.

667
00:28:32,350 --> 00:28:33,590
They're dragging on the floor.

668
00:28:33,590 --> 00:28:35,160
What do you know, nerd?

669
00:28:35,350 --> 00:28:36,280
I play games

670
00:28:36,310 --> 00:28:38,110
to experience different lives.

671
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:45,050
Cao's the class monitor now, but why did

672
00:28:45,050 --> 00:28:45,510
the homeroom teacher

673
00:28:45,510 --> 00:28:46,720
call you over for a talk?

674
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:47,440
What did he say?

675
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:49,200
The homeroom teacher told me that

676
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:50,270
being a class monitor

677
00:28:50,270 --> 00:28:52,310
would involve many chores
and affect my grades.

678
00:28:52,310 --> 00:28:53,240
He hoped that I

679
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:55,240
would still play to my own strengths.

680
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:56,260
He said it was unnecessary

681
00:28:56,260 --> 00:28:57,440
to let these trivial matters

682
00:28:57,440 --> 00:28:58,400
hold me back.

683
00:28:58,680 --> 00:29:00,740
He was specifically comforting you.

684
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,680
The homeroom teacher is quite nice to you.

685
00:29:02,680 --> 00:29:03,400
Special treatment

686
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:04,330
for first place.

687
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:06,830
Yeah!

688
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,200
After all, anyone

689
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:09,480
can run for class monitor.

690
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,960
But what about getting first place?

691
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:12,350
Not everyone can get first place.

692
00:29:12,350 --> 00:29:13,440
Getting first place

693
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:14,700
requires real skills.

694
00:29:15,830 --> 00:29:16,590
Real skills.

695
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:19,650
Real skills.

696
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:21,640
I heard you, I heard you.

697
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:24,920
Then, Qi Shi,

698
00:29:25,350 --> 00:29:27,150
our great first-place student,

699
00:29:27,270 --> 00:29:28,830
please pay this month's class fee

700
00:29:28,830 --> 00:29:30,090
and set a good example.

701
00:29:31,590 --> 00:29:32,470
Stop harboring

702
00:29:32,470 --> 00:29:33,400
so many bad intentions

703
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:35,400
and pretending to be a good student.

704
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,540
I don't have money.

705
00:29:37,790 --> 00:29:39,590
Go back and ask my brother for it.

706
00:29:41,590 --> 00:29:42,270
Okay.

707
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:50,750
Peelers.

708
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,330
Two yuan, two yuan each.

709
00:29:52,480 --> 00:29:53,310
Peelers.

710
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,420
No need to peel or chop.

711
00:29:55,590 --> 00:29:57,410
Peel with the top, drop from the bottom.

712
00:29:57,410 --> 00:29:57,890
Come on.

713
00:29:57,920 --> 00:29:59,050
Come and take a look.

714
00:29:59,510 --> 00:30:00,180
Do you know who I saw

715
00:30:00,180 --> 00:30:01,640
in the bathhouse 2 days ago?

716
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:02,110
Who?

717
00:30:02,350 --> 00:30:03,210
Director Zhou!

718
00:30:03,510 --> 00:30:04,440
Director Zhou?

719
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:05,920
He is now

720
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,350
Deputy General Manager Zhou.

721
00:30:07,350 --> 00:30:09,550
Being a director was a thing of the past.

722
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:13,070
Peelers.

723
00:30:13,350 --> 00:30:14,550
Come and take a look.

724
00:30:18,940 --> 00:30:20,460
Come and take a look.

725
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:25,970
No touching if you're not buying.

726
00:30:29,790 --> 00:30:30,720
How much is this?

727
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:32,640
This is not for sale.

728
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:33,240
Why?

729
00:30:33,800 --> 00:30:34,200
Why'd you

730
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:35,730
buy so many of these things?

731
00:30:35,960 --> 00:30:37,790
Your house is almost like a pool of toads.

732
00:30:37,790 --> 00:30:39,000
The kids like it.

733
00:30:39,400 --> 00:30:39,920
It's fun

734
00:30:40,270 --> 00:30:41,530
and makes nice sounds.

735
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,900
It looks grand at home.

736
00:30:43,960 --> 00:30:44,760
How much is it?

737
00:31:09,750 --> 00:31:11,250
It's been turned into a mining group now.

738
00:31:11,250 --> 00:31:11,830
Do you guys know

739
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:13,110
where Cao Dongfang ended up?

740
00:31:13,110 --> 00:31:15,110
He was right here, but you didn't ask him.

741
00:31:15,110 --> 00:31:17,200
Now you're asking us who only hear rumors.

742
00:31:17,200 --> 00:31:17,830
Exactly.

743
00:31:18,250 --> 00:31:19,480
If you care about Cao Dongfang so much,

744
00:31:19,480 --> 00:31:21,160
why didn't you ask him just now?

745
00:31:21,160 --> 00:31:22,090
I care about him?

746
00:31:23,270 --> 00:31:24,800
I'm hoping he gets laid off.

747
00:31:24,800 --> 00:31:25,720
You call this caring?

748
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:27,650
Then you might be waiting forever.

749
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:28,440
I heard

750
00:31:28,640 --> 00:31:29,920
he was also transferred
to the mining group

751
00:31:29,920 --> 00:31:30,590
as a section chief,

752
00:31:30,590 --> 00:31:31,590
in charge of logistics.

753
00:31:31,590 --> 00:31:32,990
He's got a title, anyway.

754
00:31:33,270 --> 00:31:34,110
Still better off

755
00:31:34,110 --> 00:31:34,790
than us.

756
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:36,630
He's a section chief now?

757
00:31:36,630 --> 00:31:37,770
Exactly.

758
00:31:46,400 --> 00:31:48,310
The fans you bought

759
00:31:48,330 --> 00:31:49,510
from Hengdong Market

760
00:31:49,510 --> 00:31:50,720
don't have rims.

761
00:31:51,350 --> 00:31:52,790
They look like the ones
fortune tellers use.

762
00:31:52,790 --> 00:31:53,850
Who would buy them?

763
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,020
They sell well.

764
00:31:55,070 --> 00:31:56,730
They're popular with old men.

765
00:31:57,030 --> 00:31:58,140
They look like

766
00:31:58,170 --> 00:31:59,420
Zhuge Liang's feather fan.

767
00:31:59,420 --> 00:32:01,640
Where is that lucky toad?

768
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:04,160
Did you sell that lucky toad?

769
00:32:06,880 --> 00:32:07,940
You really sold it?

770
00:32:08,960 --> 00:32:09,510
I sold it.

771
00:32:09,610 --> 00:32:10,680
Someone actually wanted

772
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:11,610
that ugly thing?

773
00:32:12,640 --> 00:32:14,640
It seems that
there's a market for everything.

774
00:32:14,640 --> 00:32:16,040
I'll buy a few more later.

775
00:32:16,480 --> 00:32:17,890
These crafts have a high profit margin.

776
00:32:17,890 --> 00:32:18,920
They make much more money

777
00:32:18,920 --> 00:32:20,920
than selling several boxes of soap.

778
00:32:21,070 --> 00:32:22,070
Forget it, honey.

779
00:32:23,440 --> 00:32:24,900
That thing is hard to sell.

780
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:26,920
It was sold all by luck.

781
00:32:27,550 --> 00:32:28,030
Besides,

782
00:32:28,030 --> 00:32:29,290
it's heavy and clumsy,

783
00:32:29,550 --> 00:32:30,610
and takes up space.

784
00:32:30,680 --> 00:32:32,120
Our life has just gotten a little better,

785
00:32:32,120 --> 00:32:34,650
and you're getting carried away,
aren't you?

786
00:32:35,150 --> 00:32:36,270
When Qi Shi goes to college,

787
00:32:36,270 --> 00:32:37,640
where will the tuition come from?

788
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:39,110
Can Qi Zhi look for a job and get married

789
00:32:39,110 --> 00:32:40,710
without some money saved up?

790
00:32:41,790 --> 00:32:42,720
In my opinion,

791
00:32:44,280 --> 00:32:46,540
it's pretty good not working at the mine.

792
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:48,130
Look,

793
00:32:48,750 --> 00:32:49,960
not to mention anything else,

794
00:32:49,960 --> 00:32:50,720
just

795
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:52,240
eating on time alone

796
00:32:52,980 --> 00:32:54,400
has actually cured the stomach problems

797
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:55,730
that I've had for years.

798
00:32:55,790 --> 00:32:57,160
And you don't have insomnia anymore.

799
00:32:57,160 --> 00:32:59,200
When I used to work the night shift
at the mine,

800
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:00,860
you couldn't sleep all night.

801
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:01,790
Qi Aihua,

802
00:33:01,790 --> 00:33:03,400
you're really something.

803
00:33:04,030 --> 00:33:05,440
Getting laid off

804
00:33:05,510 --> 00:33:08,170
sounds like a great thing
when you talk about it.

805
00:33:08,980 --> 00:33:10,040
All right, enough.

806
00:33:10,070 --> 00:33:11,590
Don't disturb me
while I'm doing the accounts.

807
00:33:11,590 --> 00:33:12,240
Go away.

808
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:23,860
Well, Sweetie,

809
00:33:24,590 --> 00:33:26,880
you're pouting so much.

810
00:33:27,790 --> 00:33:28,790
What's wrong?

811
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:31,280
Your mom made this stir-fried celery

812
00:33:31,280 --> 00:33:32,070
with pork for you.

813
00:33:32,070 --> 00:33:33,310
Isn't it your favorite?

814
00:33:33,310 --> 00:33:34,510
Why didn't you eat it?

815
00:33:35,160 --> 00:33:36,360
Did anyone upset you?

816
00:33:36,480 --> 00:33:37,810
It's a certain someone.

817
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:41,750
How did he become the class monitor?

818
00:33:42,590 --> 00:33:44,120
He's always one-upping me.

819
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:50,490
What's so good
about being the class monitor?

820
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:51,850
It's a waste of time.

821
00:33:52,560 --> 00:33:53,830
Your priority right now

822
00:33:53,830 --> 00:33:55,890
is to focus on your studies, you know?

823
00:33:56,400 --> 00:33:57,860
But I just can't accept it.

824
00:33:59,550 --> 00:34:01,240
They all talk a good game

825
00:34:01,830 --> 00:34:03,430
about everyone being equal.

826
00:34:04,320 --> 00:34:05,550
But when it comes to something like this,

827
00:34:05,550 --> 00:34:07,210
all the benefits go to Cao Xin.

828
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:10,870
Isn't it just because I look different?

829
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:11,639
If I looked

830
00:34:11,670 --> 00:34:12,800
like everyone else,

831
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:15,239
he wouldn't even stand a chance.

832
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:18,940
Is that what is upsetting you?

833
00:34:19,670 --> 00:34:20,800
Alright, calm down.

834
00:34:21,040 --> 00:34:21,920
Just eat up.

835
00:34:22,480 --> 00:34:23,540
It must be cold now.

836
00:34:23,719 --> 00:34:24,989
Do you want me to heat it up?

837
00:34:24,989 --> 00:34:25,630
No need.

838
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,060
Anyone

839
00:34:58,360 --> 00:34:59,820
can run for class monitor.

840
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:01,360
Not everyone can get first place.

841
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:03,760
Getting first place requires real skills.

842
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:45,760
Cao,

843
00:36:45,760 --> 00:36:47,690
did you go out stealing last night?

844
00:36:47,760 --> 00:36:48,810
Why do you seem

845
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:50,440
so listless and down lately?

846
00:36:50,840 --> 00:36:52,030
Look at your dark circles.

847
00:36:52,030 --> 00:36:54,160
They're almost bigger than your eyes.

848
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:55,960
Class,

849
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:57,230
hand in your test papers

850
00:36:57,230 --> 00:36:58,430
assigned yesterday.

851
00:37:04,120 --> 00:37:04,800
Group 1, Group 2,

852
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:06,260
what's taking you so long?

853
00:37:06,710 --> 00:37:08,410
Why are you dawdling?

854
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:25,440
Hurry up.

855
00:37:26,740 --> 00:37:28,190
Group 1, Group 2, what are you doing?

856
00:37:28,190 --> 00:37:30,050
Aren't you usually pretty quick?

857
00:37:30,550 --> 00:37:31,610
What about Group 3?

858
00:37:34,760 --> 00:37:35,360
Cao Xin,

859
00:37:36,070 --> 00:37:36,800
what is this?

860
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,550
You even put a toad on the desk!

861
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,260
Stop laughing!

862
00:37:44,590 --> 00:37:45,190
Quiet!

863
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:47,570
Go stand in the back.

864
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:51,960
Class,

865
00:37:52,030 --> 00:37:53,710
now open your textbooks

866
00:37:53,710 --> 00:37:54,570
to page 23.

867
00:37:54,710 --> 00:37:56,640
Today we are going to talk about...

868
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:58,030
The student by the window,

869
00:37:58,030 --> 00:37:58,960
stop zoning out.

870
00:37:59,320 --> 00:38:00,650
Look at the blackboard.

871
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:02,110
Look here, here!

872
00:38:04,480 --> 00:38:04,960
Right?

873
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:06,800
I think it's quite simple, too.

874
00:38:06,800 --> 00:38:07,840
We can try another one later.

875
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:09,640
What's wrong with you recently?

876
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:11,520
Is something bothering you?

877
00:38:14,070 --> 00:38:15,730
Then what's with your grades?

878
00:38:17,710 --> 00:38:18,510
In this exam,

879
00:38:18,630 --> 00:38:20,430
you almost fell out of the top 10.

880
00:38:20,510 --> 00:38:20,960
Don't take

881
00:38:20,960 --> 00:38:22,590
this gap of a dozen points lightly.

882
00:38:22,590 --> 00:38:24,250
In the college entrance exam,

883
00:38:24,550 --> 00:38:25,680
a one-point difference

884
00:38:25,680 --> 00:38:27,550
can mean thousands of competitors.

885
00:38:27,550 --> 00:38:28,280
Look at you.

886
00:38:28,720 --> 00:38:29,320
Your grades

887
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:30,630
dropped drastically this time.

888
00:38:30,630 --> 00:38:31,200
I've been

889
00:38:31,230 --> 00:38:32,440
so worried about you.

890
00:38:33,840 --> 00:38:35,030
Look at Qi Shi.

891
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:37,000
She always performs stably,

892
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:38,800
ranking either first or second.

893
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,140
You

894
00:38:41,110 --> 00:38:41,770
really need

895
00:38:41,780 --> 00:38:43,150
to reflect on yourself now.

896
00:38:43,150 --> 00:38:43,960
Try to look for what

897
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:45,090
you're doing wrong.

898
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:47,220
If you really can't figure it out,

899
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:49,060
you can go ask Qi Shi for advice

900
00:38:49,150 --> 00:38:50,610
and ask her how she does it.

901
00:38:54,630 --> 00:38:55,490
Class monitor.

902
00:38:56,110 --> 00:38:57,440
Show me your toad.

903
00:38:58,880 --> 00:39:00,610
Class monitor, class monitor!

904
00:39:04,090 --> 00:39:05,580
Did the homeroom teacher talk to you?

905
00:39:05,580 --> 00:39:06,510
Did he scold you?

906
00:39:08,980 --> 00:39:10,190
Take my advice.

907
00:39:10,270 --> 00:39:11,270
Stop struggling.

908
00:39:11,630 --> 00:39:14,480
Haven't you gotten used to it
after all these years?

909
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,250
Besides,

910
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:17,480
it's not embarrassing to lose to Qi Shi.

911
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:24,600
Come here.

912
00:39:25,110 --> 00:39:25,800
What?

913
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:32,670
Today our class will have

914
00:39:32,670 --> 00:39:34,730
the women's 800-meter fitness test.

915
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,710
Everyone, warm up first.

916
00:39:36,710 --> 00:39:37,510
Stretch a bit.

917
00:39:38,230 --> 00:39:39,690
Qi Shi, what are you doing?

918
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:41,160
Are you going to run, too?

919
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:42,150
It's an 800-meter run.

920
00:39:42,150 --> 00:39:43,320
Are you sure you can do it?

921
00:39:43,320 --> 00:39:44,550
I've never done it before.

922
00:39:44,550 --> 00:39:45,610
Let me give it a try.

923
00:39:45,940 --> 00:39:46,800
You don't have to take this test.

924
00:39:46,800 --> 00:39:47,930
Why bother doing it?

925
00:39:48,030 --> 00:39:49,670
We don't want to run, but we have to.

926
00:39:49,670 --> 00:39:50,630
Exactly.

927
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:52,590
It's exhausting.

928
00:39:54,360 --> 00:39:54,840
Qi Shi,

929
00:39:55,150 --> 00:39:56,210
you should quit it.

930
00:39:56,230 --> 00:39:56,960
It's not worth it if something

931
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:57,620
goes wrong.

932
00:39:58,280 --> 00:39:59,340
Go rest over there.

933
00:40:00,630 --> 00:40:02,030
It's fine. Just go ahead.

934
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,320
Yes, sir.

935
00:40:06,190 --> 00:40:07,650
Those in the back, keep up.

936
00:40:11,360 --> 00:40:12,560
First row, get ready.

937
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:14,510
Ready.

938
00:40:20,450 --> 00:40:21,240
Second row,

939
00:40:21,630 --> 00:40:22,230
get ready.

940
00:40:28,510 --> 00:40:29,170
Run faster!

941
00:40:37,150 --> 00:40:38,350
Third row, get ready.

942
00:41:15,840 --> 00:41:17,040
Are you daydreaming?

943
00:41:18,710 --> 00:41:19,070
Here,

944
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:20,370
wipe your drool.

945
00:41:21,110 --> 00:41:21,760
Get lost.

946
00:41:23,480 --> 00:41:24,880
Cao just can't figure out

947
00:41:25,010 --> 00:41:25,890
why you go to bed

948
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:27,030
later than him every night,

949
00:41:27,030 --> 00:41:28,290
yet you're still energetic during the day

950
00:41:28,290 --> 00:41:30,020
and even score higher than him.

951
00:41:33,030 --> 00:41:34,560
He wants to know the secret?

952
00:41:35,420 --> 00:41:36,400
Tell Cao Xin to wait

953
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:37,800
for me under the tree after school.

954
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:39,060
I'll reveal it myself.

955
00:41:42,130 --> 00:41:43,860
She's making it so mysterious.

956
00:42:06,510 --> 00:42:07,710
Does it look familiar?

957
00:42:07,710 --> 00:42:09,960
It kept you company
when you studied every day.

958
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,400
Actually, I went to bed early.

959
00:42:11,400 --> 00:42:13,600
I left the light on just to motivate you.

960
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:20,920
What are you doing?

961
00:42:20,920 --> 00:42:21,720
Just you wait.

962
00:42:22,360 --> 00:42:24,000
Are you really that mad? Why?

963
00:42:24,030 --> 00:42:25,630
You just slept a little less.

964
00:42:26,590 --> 00:42:28,000
He really can't take a joke.

965
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:29,030
So petty!

966
00:42:42,550 --> 00:42:43,190
Mrs. Huo!

967
00:42:45,630 --> 00:42:46,400
Cao Xin.

968
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:47,360
Are you hungry?

969
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:48,480
I just bought some pancakes.

970
00:42:48,480 --> 00:42:49,480
No, thanks.

971
00:42:49,750 --> 00:42:51,610
I just want to tell you something.

972
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:53,880
Haven't you noticed your electricity bill

973
00:42:53,880 --> 00:42:55,550
is higher than usual?

974
00:42:57,000 --> 00:42:58,060
Electricity bill?

975
00:42:58,920 --> 00:42:59,710
Go back and check it out.
